{"id":871,"bodyHtml":"<div><div><p>7月18日，中北大学航空宇航学院\"航心映红岚\"暑期社会实践队赴岢岚县宋家沟村开展乡村振兴实地调研，将课堂之外的思考落地为田野调查。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=uLR7UYL8-4M7WVLn4Q7nRUPLm7sUzMSkLmGiM4TfnR74nRl0gihFp2hmCIa0MSyPUSh7L1yZLlQRM47Po7WVM47YLllDMmVRLRM2Uz-PnmWFnzNiUzNaMNrFM47Zo7lJqjfTQ4Oeo4xwqsAbgDTJQty0LzGPLSyPLzvZMYbw62z8c&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=11787&e=.jpeg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/51AD281FC7118BE7121E661C03FA21F2/E95A906E/7188E\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\" 449px\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=uMNLUPM4W2Ll-PUnzW7M7lanRV2M8rSfMlrRnmlsLmfRM770gihFp2hmCIa0MSyYMkhVokh7L4GsLNrfMlCYMzQ7M4-YLN7anmvPo7-ZLmTFUNl4nz9bU4VFoRQkozNJqjfTQ4Oeo4xwqsAbgDTJQty0LzGPLSyPLzvZMYbw62z8c&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=11787&e=.jpeg\"></p><p>实践队首站抵达三棵树广场，参观宋家沟村史馆。馆内陈列的老照片、旧农具及脱贫攻坚主题展区，系统呈现了宋家沟从贫困村落至乡村振兴示范村的蝶变历程。队员们驻足\"脱贫攻坚\"展区前，结合此前支教课堂中向青少年宣讲的\"新时代乡村发展\"内容，对理论表述与基层实践的对照有了更为直观的认识。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=unRWURLRNZLzTkUnlrkM8MfM4viMlrS7UzGZM4LaL7MRLz-0gihFp2hmCIa0MShkLkhVoSyiL4TfM8UiMm-DUzl8n7UsnlU4L8n7oll4LlVFnlL4nmWkUlWFMzLZMz9JqjfTQ4Oeo4xwqsAbgDTJQty0LzGPLSyPLzvZMYbw62z8c&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=11787&e=.jpeg\" draggable=\"false\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/5B0E9539A7D5626A54DD7ED33DD9E31A/EC3F2BAB/53858\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"400px\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=unRWURLRNZLzTkUnlrkM8MfM4viMlrS7UzGZM4LaL7MRLz-0gihFp2hmCIa0MShkLkhVoSyiL4TfM8UiMm-DUzl8n7UsnlU4L8n7oll4LlVFnlL4nmWkUlWFMzLZMz9JqjfTQ4Oeo4xwqsAbgDTJQty0LzGPLSyPLzvZMYbw62z8c&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=11787&e=.jpeg\"><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=uoz7UsLRLPM878MnNQ7nNLsL4rfLNUSZMzG8oRN8nmCiL8L0gihFp2hmCIa0U1yYLkyZMYhVUmvZL77DLRCZMzrRLRVRUNCZLRCinRN4o7VFUNrkLmNPLRMFMRWknRlJqjfTQ4Oeo4xwqsAbgDTJQty0LzGPLSyPLzvZMYbw62z8c&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=11787&e=.jpeg\" draggable=\"false\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/B2087EB780A606855C01CBF8065D938A/BEB29103/42BD5\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"400px\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=uoz7UsLRLPM878MnNQ7nNLsL4rfLNUSZMzG8oRN8nmCiL8L0gihFp2hmCIa0U1yYLkyZMYhVUmvZL77DLRCZMzrRLRVRUNCZLRCinRN4o7VFUNrkLmNPLRMFMRWknRlJqjfTQ4Oeo4xwqsAbgDTJQty0LzGPLSyPLzvZMYbw62z8c&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=11787&e=.jpeg\"></p><p>调研期间，实践队与返乡创业青年刘杰进行座谈。刘杰曾于太原从事电商行业，2019年返乡创办农家乐，目前旺季入住率达90%以上。他谈及返乡创业的初衷时表示：\"在外是赚钱，回来是做事。\"实践队随后与村干部李爱岚就基层治理展开交流，详细了解危房改造、基础设施维护、游客服务反馈等日常事务的处置机制。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=uoRCU4nRlYnm9PUnNWkM8CbU47YU8LSZMRCbnN-PnzCaU4l0gihFp2hmCIa0nSy4okyan1yso7LbMRNZU4C4o7MVo7laM8r2MzUDL49sM7MFLRQVMNl8L4TFMlliozLJqjfjo4OeoDAK_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg47PM49sgtA8pUzcc&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=11787&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/E380F78C9498C638CE8E07EF5463874C/06E6E439/5E593\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"700\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=uoRCU4nRlYnm9PUnNWkM8CbU47YU8LSZMRCbnN-PnzCaU4l0gihFp2hmCIa0nSy4okyan1yso7LbMRNZU4C4o7MVo7laM8r2MzUDL49sM7MFLRQVMNl8L4TFMlliozLJqjfjo4OeoDAK_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg47PM49sgtA8pUzcc&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=11787&e=.jpg\"></p><p>午后，实践队分组向村民、基层干部及往来游客发放乡村振兴调研问卷，围绕产业发展、基础设施、文旅服务、基层治理等维度收集一手数据。调研共回收有效问卷40余份，为后续分析岢岚乡村振兴实践提供了素材支撑。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=un7nURnRU4L878Un474M8rVUmA7L4fS2LNQfMRNDMNC8oRG0gihFp2hmCIa0LSyanSyDUSh7LzvZLRQRnmvsnz6Rn7CPU4V7UzVfoR67olMFUzGboRL4LmQFLzlsoRvJqjfjo4OeoDAK_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg47PM49sgtA8pUzcc&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=11787&e=.jpg\" draggable=\"false\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/10E6AD17806CF77E7CDF1C1DA1A87D9C/A0983326/15787\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\" 385px\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=un7nURnRU4L878Un474M8rVUmA7L4fS2LNQfMRNDMNC8oRG0gihFp2hmCIa0LSyanSyDUSh7LzvZLRQRnmvsnz6Rn7CPU4V7UzVfoR67olMFUzGboRL4LmQFLzlsoRvJqjfjo4OeoDAK_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg47PM49sgtA8pUzcc&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=11787&e=.jpg\"><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=uUmCUbUl78Mmn7LnlQ2MNn2MR-iMzASVM8nVLRUPnzlsU4v0gihFp2hmCIa0U1yPLkyDL1h7Um9ZL4NsnR7DLmUaU8CZUl-sM49DL7Q2UzrFMR-sMR6kLmfFLllDUm-Jqjfjo4OeoDAK_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg47PM49sgtA8pUzcc&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=11787&e=.jpg\" draggable=\"false\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/B1062DB88397D16240CF8AB77860FFA5/42747B20/1E6B2\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"400px\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=uUmCUbUl78Mmn7LnlQ2MNn2MR-iMzASVM8nVLRUPnzlsU4v0gihFp2hmCIa0U1yPLkyDL1h7Um9ZL4NsnR7DLmUaU8CZUl-sM49DL7Q2UzrFMR-sMR6kLmfFLllDUm-Jqjfjo4OeoDAK_dN0qIbtpYyPLR7Pg47PM49sgtA8pUzcc&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=11787&e=.jpg\"></p><p>此次调研使实践队成员对乡村振兴战略的基层实施路径有了更为系统的理解，也为进一步探索\"专业+志愿\"服务模式积累了实践经验。</p></div></div>","bodyText":"","attachments":[],"image":"http://hkyh.nuc.edu.cn/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=uLR7UYL8-4M7WVLn4Q7nRUPLm7sUzMSkLmGiM4TfnR74nRl0gihFp2hmCIa0MSyPUSh7L1yZLlQRM47Po7WVM47YLllDMmVRLRM2Uz-PnmWFnzNiUzNaMNrFM47Zo7lJqjfTQ4Oeo4xwqsAbgDTJQty0LzGPLSyPLzvZMYbw62z8c&oid=1855776123&tid=1011&nid=11787&e=.jpeg"}